        "original_id": "819a41c1-7106-579c-80c1-997caa3fb8b9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Gordon Green, Larry Hagman, Caroline Grace Cassidy\n- Characters: J. R. Ewing\n- Works: Dallas, I Dream of Jeannie, Your Highness\n\nFacts:\n- David Gordon Green was born on April 9, 1975, and is an American filmmaker.\n- Larry Martin Hagman was born on September 21, 1931, and was an American film and television actor, director, and producer.\n- Larry Hagman was best known for playing J. R. Ewing in the 1980s primetime television soap opera Dallas.\n- Larry Hagman was also known for playing Major Anthony \"Tony\" Nelson in the 1960s sitcom I Dream of Jeannie.\n- J. R. Ewing was portrayed by Larry Hagman from the Dallas series premiere in 1978 until Hagman’s death in late 2012.\n- Larry Hagman was the only actor who appeared in all 357 episodes of the original Dallas series.\n- Larry Hagman died on November 23, 2012.\n- Caroline Grace Cassidy is best known for her role in David Gordon Green’s film Your Highness.",
